# A thread's drawing (an extension): the thread of path_thread, then
# File > Drawing Sheet, where "threads as modelled" turns the drafting
# convention off, and on again.
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# The designation, the length, an internal thread, then make it.
twmove 172 110
twdown L 172 110
twup L 172 110
edit M6x1
twmove 190 150
twdown L 190 150
twup L 190 150
edit 9
twmove 181 190
twdown L 181 190
twup L 181 190
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
menu View|Drawing Sheet...
twmove 262 190
twdown L 262 190
twup L 262 190
tw
dump
menu View|Drawing Sheet...
tw
twmove 262 190
twdown L 262 190
twup L 262 190
tw
dump
save
